WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
There is a hurdle at the age of eighteen for those who are weak in water.

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,520
I saved it thanks to favors

3
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:06,910
I wanted to tell them in my dreams at night

4
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:09,790
But I had something urgent to deal with that night and forgot about it.

5
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:11,670
Unexpectedly, the next morning

6
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:13,630
Zhong Yuquan came to my temple and cursed

7
00:00:13,950 --> 00:00:15,990
It turns out that the couple have been feeling unwell recently.

8
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:17,590
Zhong Yuquan thought it was me.

9
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,740
This man is indeed a bit

10
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:20,900
Although I am angry

11
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:22,620
But look at them making a temple for me

12
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:24,020
I checked it anyway

13
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,420
I found out that it was the ancestors of the previous Sitang Dan who came to grind them.

14
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,060
I stopped them for them.

15
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,900
But I never expected that that night

16
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:32,860
Zhong Yuquan took advantage of me when I was out

17
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:36,100
He actually smashed my temple. What happened next?

18
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:37,500
you can ask him

19
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:38,900
How is his master?

20
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:41,860
I heard my mother say before

21
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,460
I don’t know why suddenly one day

22
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:44,860
My grandma seems crazy

23
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,740
Always chasing my master with a knife in his hand

24
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:49,140
I didn't directly kill him.

25
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:52,180
I'm already showing mercy, so I don't understand.

26
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:55,380
According to you, Zhong Yuquan is the culprit and you have also taken revenge.

27
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:57,140
Why are you still causing trouble for Zhong Yushui?

28
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:00,340
Why did their family make me homeless?

29
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:02,060
Then he also established Tangkou

30
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,280
Then I am still considered an old fragrant root.

31
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:07,000
Don’t I have a say in the Zhong family?

32
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,040
Why didn’t I see him enshrine me?
